<title>USA: Ohio $282 mln bonds won by Goldman at 5.06 pct NIC.</title>
<headline>Ohio $282 mln bonds won by Goldman at 5.06 pct NIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. said Thursday it won $282.3 million Ohio higher education capital facilities bonds at a net interest cost of 5.06 percent.</p>
</text>
